# Product image creation

Full standard: `data/PRODUCT-IMAGE-STANDARD.md`

## Catalogue paths

| Prefix | Path |
| --- | --- |
| `kn-*` | `/images/products/kn/{id}.png` |
| `gg-*` | `/images/products/apparel/{id}.png` |
| `bh-*` | `/images/products/home/{id}.png` |

## Style (match Labels / Tapes / Elastics / Hangers)

- Seamless white background, soft studio light, subtle contact shadow
- Photorealistic single-product packshot
- No text, watermarks, logos, or range-sheet collages

## Forbidden

- Original range sheets / `crops/`
- SVG template icons as catalogue images for `gg-*` / `bh-*`
